<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

	<!--
		The six insect momo xenotypes. Every one carries ProjectMomo_Momo +
		PMM_Gene_Insect (chitin, feelers) and is inheritable, all-female and excluded
		from the factionless spawner (factionlessGenerationWeight 0 — they only enter
		the world in the two insector tribes). The bulk of each species' stats lives
		on its race def (Races_InsectMomo_BS.xml); the genes here add the MGE
		flavour on top. Gene defNames verified against Core/Biotech 1.6.

		Each xenotype also declares its race with Big & Small's XenotypeExtension
		(setRace). That is the only link between a species' genes and its race def,
		and it matters because the race def holds the real physiology: temperature
		range, body size, melee tools and race abilities such as the abaddon's
		egg-spew. Big & Small applies the field when a pawn is GENERATED; PMM core
		re-applies it when a woman is transformed into one of these xenotypes at
		runtime, so a corrupted woman becomes the species properly instead of
		wearing its genes on a baseliner body.

		forceRace is on for all six: without it, a mere gene request for a winged
		body (the flight genes carry one) can win the swap over the species race,
		and the pawn ends up as a plain winged human with no species at all.
	-->

	<!-- Devil Bug (megascarab): tireless, scent-hungry, fast-crawling -->
	<XenotypeDef>
		<defName>PMM_InsectDevilBug</defName>
		<label>devil bug</label>
		<description>An insect momo of swarms and dark, damp places. Her feelers quiver at the scent of a man from rooms away, and once she has the smell of him she never tires and never stops — hunger and lust are the only thoughts she has room for.</description>
		<descriptionShort>A simple, tireless insect momo who hunts men by scent.</descriptionShort>
		<iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/PMM_DevilBug</iconPath>
		<inheritable>true</inheritable>
		<factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
		<genes>
			<li>ProjectMomo_Momo</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Insect</li>
			<li>MoveSpeed_Quick</li>
			<li>AptitudeRemarkable_Animals</li>
			<!-- VRE Insector (HANDOFF §5.3), born not unlocked: she mends fast and
			     shrugs off illness, and she hunts in the dark by heat - InfraredSensors
			     is a Kemia pherocore gene, which the player unlocks by recruiting her.
			     Her prices: a body that burns in the sun, and a life cycle that burns
			     out fast - a swarm drone is many and short-lived, where the queen is
			     one and never ages. Two and two, as the geneline picker demands
			     (VRE_NeedEqualAmount). -->
			<li>VRE_AntimicrobialPeptides</li>
			<li>VRE_InfraredSensors</li>
			<li>VRE_Heatstress</li>
			<li>VRE_RapidLifeCycle</li>
			<!-- Jelly on the fighting castes only, never the greenworm. The pheromones
			     that keep real insectoids off her are not a gene from VRE any more:
			     PMM_Gene_Insect carries that effect itself, in
			     Source/Insects/InsectPheromones.cs. -->
			<li>VRE_InsectJellyDependency</li>
			<!-- Chitin tone: vanilla keeps one of the five at random per momo. -->
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinPale</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinOlive</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinMoss</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinUmber</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinDark</li>
		</genes>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="BigAndSmall.XenotypeExtension">
				<setRace>PMM_Race_DevilBug</setRace>
				<forceRace>true</forceRace>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</XenotypeDef>

	<!-- Giant Ant (spelopede): diligent worker, digging claws, great strength -->
	<XenotypeDef>
		<defName>PMM_InsectGiantAnt</defName>
		<label>giant ant</label>
		<description>A worker caste momo of the deep nests. Honest and diligent, she digs through solid rock and carries loads larger than herself without complaint — though the pheromones in her sweat grow heavier the harder she works.</description>
		<descriptionShort>A diligent, strong insect momo born to dig and haul.</descriptionShort>
		<iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/PMM_GiantAnt</iconPath>
		<inheritable>true</inheritable>
		<factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
		<genes>
			<li>ProjectMomo_Momo</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Insect</li>
			<li>AptitudeRemarkable_Mining</li>
			<li>AptitudeRemarkable_Construction</li>
			<!-- VRE Insector (HANDOFF §5.3): Hiveglands is the gene that lets her
			     raise VFEI2 hives, and she and the greenworm are the tribe's two
			     builders - which is why her hands are for building and digging, not
			     for brawling. SpelopedeHorn is her digging horn; Dormant and
			     LowGreyMatter pay for both - a worker drone who sleeps hard and does
			     not think. Two evolutions, two degrades. -->
			<li>VRE_Hiveglands</li>
			<li>VRE_SpelopedeHorn</li>
			<li>VRE_Dormant</li>
			<li>VRE_LowGreyMatter</li>
			<li>VRE_InsectJellyDependency</li>
			<!-- Chitin tone: vanilla keeps one of the five at random per momo. -->
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinPale</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinOlive</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinMoss</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinUmber</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinDark</li>
		</genes>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="BigAndSmall.XenotypeExtension">
				<setRace>PMM_Race_GiantAnt</setRace>
				<forceRace>true</forceRace>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</XenotypeDef>

	<!-- Soldier Beetle (megaspider): heavy armour, ripper blades, hidden wings -->
	<XenotypeDef>
		<defName>PMM_InsectSoldierBeetle</defName>
		<label>soldier beetle</label>
		<description>Heavy cavalry from birth. Her exoskeleton turns aside swords and arrows, her claws are ripper-blades, and hidden beneath the carapace on her back are wings for short bursts of flight. Calm, obedient and nearly expressionless — until she chooses a man to escort.</description>
		<descriptionShort>An armoured, obedient insect momo with ripper claws and hidden wings.</descriptionShort>
		<iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/PMM_SoldierBeetle</iconPath>
		<inheritable>true</inheritable>
		<factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
		<genes>
			<li>ProjectMomo_Momo</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Insect</li>
			<li>Robust</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_FlightWeak</li>
			<!-- Large frame (core): the heavy cavalry frame that carries more. She
			     is a weak flyer, not a strong one, so the two genes do not clash. -->
			<li>PMM_Gene_LargeFrame</li>
			<li>MeleeDamage_Strong</li>
			<!-- VRE Insector (HANDOFF §5.3): HardenedChitin turns aside a quarter of
			     all incoming damage and CuticleShell shrugs off common disease. That
			     much body costs her: InefficientMidgut means she must eat far more,
			     and Stenothermic means she only thrives in her own climate. Two and
			     two. -->
			<li>VRE_HardenedChitin</li>
			<li>VRE_CuticleShell</li>
			<li>VRE_InefficientMidgut</li>
			<li>VRE_Stenothermic</li>
			<li>VRE_InsectJellyDependency</li>
			<!-- Chitin tone: vanilla keeps one of the five at random per momo. -->
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinPale</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinOlive</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinMoss</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinUmber</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinDark</li>
		</genes>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="BigAndSmall.XenotypeExtension">
				<setRace>PMM_Race_SoldierBeetle</setRace>
				<forceRace>true</forceRace>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</XenotypeDef>

	<!-- Greenworm (larva, Odyssey): soft, gentle, slow, acid secretion -->
	<XenotypeDef>
		<defName MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey">PMM_InsectGreenworm</defName>
		<label>greenworm</label>
		<description>A soft-bodied, gentle momo who loves nothing more than eating. Her antennae secrete a strange-smelling substance that saps the strength of anything that threatens her — and she spits the same sludge in fright.</description>
		<descriptionShort>A soft, gentle insect momo who spits acidic sludge.</descriptionShort>
		<iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/PMM_Greenworm</iconPath>
		<inheritable>true</inheritable>
		<factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
		<genes>
			<li>ProjectMomo_Momo</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Insect</li>
			<li>AptitudeRemarkable_Construction</li>
			<!-- VRE Insector (HANDOFF §5.3): a hive builder like the ant, and a
			     midgut that gets full value from raw food. Her prices suit a grub:
			     Immunodeficiency (soft flesh with no defence against illness) and
			     HypothermicHibernation (when the cold bites she simply sleeps, as a
			     grub does). No VRE acid glands - she already has SludgeSpew - and no
			     jelly gene: she is brood, not a fighter. Two and two. -->
			<li>VRE_Hiveglands</li>
			<li>VRE_RobustMidgut</li>
			<li>VRE_Immunodeficiency</li>
			<li>VRE_HypothermicHibernation</li>
			<!-- Chitin tone: vanilla keeps one of the five at random per momo. -->
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinPale</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinOlive</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinMoss</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinUmber</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinDark</li>
		</genes>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="BigAndSmall.XenotypeExtension">
				<setRace>PMM_Race_Greenworm</setRace>
				<forceRace>true</forceRace>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</XenotypeDef>

	<!-- Vamp Mosquito (locust, Odyssey): thin buzzing wings and weak flight (no
	     caravan speed, no passenger), venomous bite, blood-drinking -->
	<XenotypeDef>
		<defName MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey">PMM_InsectVampMosquito</defName>
		<label>vamp mosquito</label>
		<description>The vampire of the insect world. Cunning and mean, she stalks her prey on buzzing wings and strikes when their guard drops. Her bite carries a venom that makes the wound hot and throbbing — and only her touch soothes it. She drinks blood most greedily in her lover's arms.</description>
		<descriptionShort>A winged, blood-drinking insect momo with a venomous bite.</descriptionShort>
		<iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/PMM_VampMosquito</iconPath>
		<inheritable>true</inheritable>
		<factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
		<genes>
			<li>ProjectMomo_Momo</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Insect</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_FlightWeak</li>
			<li>Beauty_Beautiful</li>
			<!-- VRE Insector (HANDOFF §5.3): HighGreyMatter is her cunning - she
			     learns fast and reads people - and AntimicrobialPeptides keeps her
			     mending. AcidBlood and WeakenedChitin pay for both: her blood smokes
			     with tox gas when she is cut, and her shell is thin. That gas is a
			     gift to a raider, since every momo is immune to it now and the
			     player's people are not. Two and two. -->
			<li>VRE_HighGreyMatter</li>
			<li>VRE_AntimicrobialPeptides</li>
			<li>VRE_AcidBlood</li>
			<li>VRE_WeakenedChitin</li>
			<li>VRE_InsectJellyDependency</li>
			<!-- Chitin tone: vanilla keeps one of the five at random per momo. -->
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinPale</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinOlive</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinMoss</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinUmber</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinDark</li>
		</genes>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="BigAndSmall.XenotypeExtension">
				<setRace>PMM_Race_VampMosquito</setRace>
				<forceRace>true</forceRace>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</XenotypeDef>

	<!-- Abaddon (hive queen, Odyssey): the devouring queen, never sleeps, egg-spew -->
	<XenotypeDef>
		<defName MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey">PMM_InsectAbaddon</defName>
		<label>abaddon</label>
		<description>Daughter of the bug mamono lord who nearly devoured the world in antiquity. Quiet and spacey rather than ferocious, but her appetite — and her fertility — are without limit. Her pheromones command the swarm, her wingbeats shake the heavens, and once she devotes herself to a man it is for life.</description>
		<descriptionShort>A sleepless queen momo of limitless appetite and fertility.</descriptionShort>
		<iconPath>UI/Icons/Xenotypes/PMM_Abaddon</iconPath>
		<inheritable>true</inheritable>
		<factionlessGenerationWeight>0</factionlessGenerationWeight>
		<genes>
			<li>ProjectMomo_Momo</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Insect</li>
			<li>PMM_Gene_Flight</li>
			<li>AptitudeRemarkable_Social</li>
			<li>AptitudeStrong_Intellectual</li>
			<!-- VRE Insector (HANDOFF §5.3), the royal package: SwarmSynapse is
			     Sorne's pherocore gene, SpawningSack is her fertility, and
			     SlowedLifeCycle means she never ages. Her three prices:
			     ProteinDenaturation (sunlight burns her, so she keeps to the hive),
			     HypothermicHibernation (she sleeps through the cold) and
			     HardLockedJoints (she waddles, she does not walk). Three and three,
			     as the geneline picker demands. -->
			<li>VRE_SwarmSynapse</li>
			<li>VRE_SpawningSack</li>
			<li>VRE_SlowedLifeCycle</li>
			<li>VRE_ProteinDenaturation</li>
			<li>VRE_HypothermicHibernation</li>
			<li>VRE_HardLockedJoints</li>
			<li>VRE_InsectJellyDependency</li>
			<!-- Chitin tone: vanilla keeps one of the five at random per momo. -->
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinPale</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinOlive</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinMoss</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinUmber</li>
			<li>PMM_Skin_ChitinDark</li>
		</genes>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="BigAndSmall.XenotypeExtension">
				<setRace>PMM_Race_Abaddon</setRace>
				<forceRace>true</forceRace>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</XenotypeDef>

</Defs>
